+**CV04 — inherited integration lanes.** Ten forward copies execute six inherited classes, 87 distinct cases. `inherited-copy-final/inventory.json` has exact original/current-copy hashes and complete patches; historical preindex/schema14 inventories remain unchanged. Meeting revision/concurrency, B04 authority, facts reader, prepared completion and archive restart assertions are retained with fresh identities, paths, pools and schema14 guards. No reset, old migration or old raw-output path executes. The original global outbox-sequence overflow test is explicitly excluded; actual flush failure injection supplies the stated atomicity equivalent, not a claim of original-class full execution. Metadata reader/archive and queue fixtures are controlled fixtures, not actual intake→Worker qualification. The archive lane retains five fresh processes and original immutable archive references with changed defaults and negative recovery cases.
