+## Typed-input index prerequisite and qualification
+
+The root independently reviewed the 75-byte `V013_2__task_input_lookup.sql`, SHA `11adae7d1d6b46bc7918692593abfbedf84c57a1d79dbe61f46a2c345d68878f`, formally allocated version013.2 and issued a separate selected-target application ACK. This is the explicit supplement to original no-DDL scope. Original thirteen SQL files and all four current model/generator files remain unchanged; Task8 owns later model synchronization.
